{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19760","headline":"古薄命妾 · 孟郊","name":"古薄命妾","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不惜十指弦，爲君千万弹。\n常恐新声至，坐使故声残。\n弃置今日悲，即是昨日欢。\n将新变故易，持故爲新难。\n青山有蘼芜，泪叶长不乾。\n空令後代人，采掇幽思攒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19760.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19760","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}